  message: <<EOM
To enable cloud-init at boot, add the following to /etc/rc.conf:

    cloudinit_enable="YES"

The default config is installed as %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.sample --
copy or symlink it to cloud.cfg (without .sample) to activate it, or provide
your own. See %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.d/ for drop-in overrides.
EOM
